  volume   =  128,
  number   =  12,
  pages    = "2283--2294",
  abstract = "BACKGROUND: The distribution of ovarian tumour characteristics
              differs between germline BRCA1 and BRCA2 pathogenic variant
              carriers and non-carriers. In this study, we assessed the utility
              of ovarian tumour characteristics as predictors of BRCA1 and BRCA2
              variant pathogenicity, for application using the American College
              of Medical Genetics and the Association for Molecular Pathology
              (ACMG/AMP) variant classification system. METHODS: Data for 10,373
              ovarian cancer cases, including carriers and non-carriers of BRCA1
