              invasion and age at diagnosis. CONCLUSIONS: We provide detailed
              estimates for predicting BRCA1 and BRCA2 variant pathogenicity
              based on ovarian tumour characteristics. This evidence can be
              combined with other variant information under the ACMG/AMP
              classification system, to improve classification and carrier
              clinical management.",
