  abstract = "Breast cancer susceptibility variants frequently show
              heterogeneity in associations by tumor subtype1-3. To identify
              novel loci, we performed a genome-wide association study including
              133,384 breast cancer cases and 113,789 controls, plus 18,908
              BRCA1 mutation carriers (9,414 with breast cancer) of European
