  journal  = "Am. J. Hum. Genet.",
  volume   =  104,
  number   =  1,
  pages    = "21--34",
  abstract = "Stratification of women according to their risk of breast cancer
              based on polygenic risk scores (PRSs) could improve screening and
              prevention strategies. Our aim was to develop PRSs, optimized for
              prediction of estrogen receptor (ER)-specific disease, from the
