  journal  = "Nat. Med.",
  volume   =  26,
  number   =  8,
  pages    = "1271--1279",
  abstract = "Malignant abdominal fluid (ascites) frequently develops in women
              with advanced high-grade serous ovarian cancer (HGSOC) and is
              associated with drug resistance and a poor prognosis1. To
              comprehensively characterize the HGSOC ascites ecosystem, we used
