              stroma of ``metastasis-prone'' breast cancer patients was most
              closely related to the transcriptional profiles derived from the
              brains of patients with Alzheimer's disease. This suggests that
              certain fundamental biological processes are common to both an
              activated tumor stroma and neuro-degenerative stress. These
