              biology: A report from the Children's Oncology Group",
  author   = "Roberts, Ryan D and Lizardo, Michael M and Reed, Damon R and
              Hingorani, Pooja and Glover, Jason and Allen-Rhoades, Wendy and
              Fan, Timothy and Khanna, Chand and Sweet-Cordero, E Alejandro and
