  pages    = "166--183.e25",
  abstract = "To better understand intrinsic resistance to immune checkpoint
              blockade (ICB), we established a comprehensive view of the
              cellular architecture of the treatment-naive melanoma ecosystem
              and studied its evolution under ICB. Using single-cell, spatial
              multi-omics, we showed that the tumor microenvironment promotes
